{title: Reflection}
{artist: Matthew Wilder & David Zippel}
{year: 1998}
{key: A}
{meta: firstline Look at me, you may think you see}
{meta: movie Mulan}
{define: "First note" copy "bb"}

{define: F# base-fret 1 frets 3 1 2 1}
{define: F#m base-fret 1 frets 2 1 2 0}
{define: D#m base-fret 1 frets 3 3 2 1}
{define: D* base-fret 2 frets 1 1 1 4 fingers 1 1 1 4}
{define: D7M base-fret 1 frets 2 2 2 4 fingers 1 1 1 3}
{define: D6 base-fret 1 frets 2 2 2 2 fingers 1 1 1 1}
{define: G#m base-fret 1 frets 1 3 4 2}
{define: C# base-fret 1 frets 1 1 1 4}
{define: A* base-fret 1 frets 2 1 0 4}

[<hidden>First note</hidden>]

{comment: Verse 1}
[F#]Look at me
I will [D#m]never pass for a [G#m]perfect bride
[F#]Or a perfect [C#]daughter
[F#]Can it be I'm not [D#m]meant to play this [E]part?
[A]Now I see, that if [F#m]I were truly to [Bm]be myself
[Dm]I would break my family's [A]heart

{start_of_chorus}
[A]Who is that [F#m]girl I see
[E]Staring [D]straight [Dm]back at me?
[A]Why [E]is [F#m]my [Bm]re[D7M]flection
Someone [G]I don't [E]know? 
{end_of_chorus}

{comment: Verse 2}
[A]Somehow I [F#m]cannot hide
[E]Who I am, [D]though I've [Dm]tried
[A]When [E]will [F#m]my [Bm]re[D7M]flec[D*]tion [D6]show
[Dm]Who I am [A*]inside?
[A]When [E]will [F#m]my [Bm]re[D7M]flec[D*]tion [D6]show
[Dm]Who I am [D]inside? [A]
